sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as vllm-orchestrator-gateway<br/>8090/TCP HTTP
    participant Orchestrator as TrustyAI Orchestrator<br/>configurable port<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (optional mTLS)

    Note over Gateway: Startup: loads config.yaml,<br/>creates dynamic routes per<br/>configured route name

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,Orchestrator: Non-Streaming Chat Completion with Detection
        Client->>Gateway: POST /{route_name}/v1/chat/completions<br/>Content-Type: application/json<br/>Authorization: Bearer token (optional)<br/>{"model":"...","messages":[...],"stream":false}
        Note over Gateway: Enrich request with route-specific<br/>detector configs (input + output detectors)
        Gateway->>Orchestrator: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>Authorization: forwarded<br/>{"model":"...","messages":[...],"detectors":{...}}
        Note over Orchestrator: Runs configured detectors<br/>(content safety evaluation)
        Orchestrator-->>Gateway: JSON Response<br/>{"choices":[...],"detections":{...}}
        Note over Gateway: Check detections:<br/>if flagged → substitute fallback message
        Gateway-->>Client: JSON Response<br/>{"choices":[{"message":{"content":"..."}}]}
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Client,Orchestrator: Streaming Chat Completion with Detection
        Client->>Gateway: POST /{route_name}/v1/chat/completions<br/>{"model":"...","messages":[...],"stream":true}
        Note over Gateway: Enrich with detector configs
        Gateway->>Orchestrator: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>{"model":"...","messages":[...],"stream":true,"detectors":{...}}
        loop SSE Event Stream
            Orchestrator-->>Gateway: data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"content":"..."}}]}
            Note over Gateway: Parse SSE chunk,<br/>check for detection flags
            Gateway-->>Client: data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"content":"..."}}]}
        end
        Orchestrator-->>Gateway: data: [DONE]
        Gateway-->>Client: data: [DONE]
    end
